    },
    {
      eyebrow: "Experimental",
      title: "Raven subsystem",
      body: "Ojuny includes Raven as an experimental Windows subsystem. It associates .exe, .msi, and .bat files, so a double-click installer opens through Raven exactly like Windows. Raven is not a finished product, and some installers and games will fail.",
